    serial_port:=/dev/ttyACM0 explicitly (or whatever ls /dev/tty* shows when
    the board is plugged in).
  - Set use_mock_hardware:=false only once the board is flashed with the
    micro-ROS firmware and physically connected — otherwise the agent will sit
    there with nothing to talk to.
  - Since you said RViz and Gazebo are already running, launching this servo
    bringup is a separate real-hardware control stack — run it alongside, not
    instead of, your sim stack; they both drive the same /arm_controller and
    /gripper_controller topic interface, just pointed at different hardware
    backends.

